        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cogen unit 1MWe, common components for heat+electricity</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cogen unit 1MWe, common components for heat+electricity
The module summarises infrastructure components of a cogeneration unit. ;
UUID: e0ef25e1-b21f-3735-9400-7c78de053f68
The module includes all shared components for heat and electricity production.
Location: Extrapolated from data of a plant in Switzerland, assumed valid for Europe (RER).
Technology: Extrapolated from data of a 160kWe lambda=1 plant, adjusted to lean burn technology currently available on market, no catalytic converters.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Operator and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text, see Technolgy Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e0ef25e1-b21f-3735-9400-7c78de053f68.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
